{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YEAH YEAH IT LOOKS EASY, TRY IT THEN</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playgrounds are silent, smiles are scheduled, and fun is filed under \u201cforbidden.\u201d In this clock-punching land of absolute order, one ordinary man refuses to lock away his inner kid. Stuffed into a slapdash cardboard mech suit, he bounces skyward to prove that chaos is worth every bruise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/34fdc199b25efa2f80e272f9f2720b13.poster.avif?t=1760349317\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/34fdc199b25efa2f80e272f9f2720b13.webm?t=1760349317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/34fdc199b25efa2f80e272f9f2720b13.mp4?t=1760349317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pogo Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Pure Momentum</strong> \u2013 Every jab of the spring obeys real-world inertia(kinda:); miss the angle and you\u2019ll ricochet straight back to pavement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>No Checkpoints</strong> \u2013 One slip, restart. Skill \u2014 or sheer stubbornness \u2014 is all that keeps you going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Tilt, Snap, Shatter</strong> \u2013 Platforms sway, crumble, or launch you skyward like a catapult; every surface becomes a fresh launchpad for your next leap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/6b274671396412687513df9dfda9c593.poster.avif?t=1760349317\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/6b274671396412687513df9dfda9c593.webm?t=1760349317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/6b274671396412687513df9dfda9c593.mp4?t=1760349317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Jet Jitters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Micro Thruster</strong> \u2013 A jury-rigged jetpack gives a heartbeat of thrust \u2014 just enough to rescue you\u2026 or send you spiraling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Fuel on Fumes</strong> \u2013 The tank empties in seconds; refills are scarce and never convenient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Last-Chance Heroics</strong> \u2013 Fire the thruster at the perfect millisecond to salvage free-fall panic or stretch your flight by a few humbling meters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/61006fc01d56be5b62a92e10b13bf598.poster.avif?t=1760349317\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/61006fc01d56be5b62a92e10b13bf598.webm?t=1760349317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/61006fc01d56be5b62a92e10b13bf598.mp4?t=1760349317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Obstacles With Issues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge moving walls that track your hops, swinging wrecking hammers, cannons that treat you like target practice \u2014 everything here craves a cardboard casserole. Outsmart them or taste the defeat .</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bounce, Crash, Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect spectacular ascents, catastrophic nosedives, and the smug grin of gravity itself. Each wipeout is a lesson; every retry is a victory lap for your sanity (and your bruises). Gravity may pull you down, but it can't stop you from going up! That\u2019s where the glory\u2019s at.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up \u2014 cereal boxes and all. (Single-player now; co-op climbing madness coming soon!) See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.  <br> <br> <br> <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902930?t=1760349317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902930?t=1760349317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/f0979f2257648195768e2dd399dc0443dee33960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760349317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/f0979f2257648195768e2dd399dc0443dee33960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760349317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4092490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YEAH YEAH IT LOOKS EASY, TRY IT THEN</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Machine</s