scents, catastrophic nosedives, and the smug grin of gravity itself. Each wipeout is a lesson; every retry is a victory lap for your sanity (and your bruises). Gravity may pull you down, but it can't stop you from going up! That\u2019s where the glory\u2019s at.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up \u2014 cereal boxes and all. (Single-player now; co-op climbing madness coming soon!) See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.  <br> <br> <br> <br> </p>","developers":["Bruder Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/8c9ed32676608bddbf9a7ec40b1f7f0037ce822d/header.jpg?t=1760349317","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902930/1727806513/fe385c5c19049a94f131237a16532d23cd1724cb/1755091779/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755093473","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902930/1727806513/fe385c5c19049a94f131237a16532d23cd1724cb/1755091779/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755093473","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902930/1727806513/fe385c5c19049a94f131237a16532d23cd1724cb/1755091779/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755093473","id":257182643,"name":"Pogo Panic Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182643/02de4138e1db7048b27c2e1c2ae5e268beb40be4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755093473"}],"name":"Pogo Panic","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB avail