faec7fed228e91fd90e2e827a64310/ss_6a962eb274faec7fed228e91fd90e2e827a64310.600x338.jpg?t=1760349317"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/98a5b112f2a428331a051ba57d20cfab66c77d53/ss_98a5b112f2a428331a051ba57d20cfab66c77d53.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760349317","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/98a5b112f2a428331a051ba57d20cfab66c77d53/ss_98a5b112f2a428331a051ba57d20cfab66c77d53.600x338.jpg?t=1760349317"}],"short_description":"Pogo Panic is a difficult, Parkour Adventure. Bounce on a pogo stick, ignite a fleeting jetpack, and vault through space. One slip-jump takes you back to the start\u2014no checkpoints. Fail, rebound, and master the sky one desperate hop at a time.","steam_appid":3902930,"support_info":{"email":"brudergames.info@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}